Future-perspective review complete and saved to `docs/content-analysis/perspective-reviews/Duke-Dennis/2026-08-07_020002/future.md` (SHA verified against context.json before review).

**Verdict:** trust intact, value high, recommendation **revise** — 0 blockers, 8 concerns. The piece is unusually durable: the thesis rests on 2013–2018 biography plus the February 2024 interview rather than the news cycle, and nearly every load-bearing event carries an absolute date.

**Strongest hit:** the draft's self-aging hedge — Duke's own "what starts off cool eventually turns corny" pre-explains the decay of the piece's rizz hook, so even if the slang dies by 2027 the article reads as an account of the era, not a stale trend piece.

**Highest-priority concern (FUTURE-C1):** the draft's deliberate "current-tense anchor" was already expired at publication. "The man who refuses every label... **now grades** students" — but Streamer University 2026 ran July 15–20, per [Deltia's Gaming](https://deltiasgaming.com/kai-cenat-reveals-streamer-university-2026s-starting-date/), [Sportskeeda](https://www.sportskeeda.com/us/streamers/news-streamer-university-2026-date-information-revealed), and [Complex](https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/a/tracewilliamcowen/kai-cenat-streamer-university-2026-how-watch), while the draft is dated August 7. One clause fixes it. Runner-up findings: the TL;DR's "still calls enlisting the worst decision of his life" (a 2018 stance his 2024 tape softened), undated follower counts, and the article asserting AMP's sealed-six permanence in its own voice instead of Duke's. A debunked fake-mugshot rumor from August 4 ([Primetimer](https://www.primetimer.com/news/did-duke-dennis-get-arrested-for-murder-viral-mugshot-tweet-claim-debunked)) also argues for bounding "the only legal mark on a decade of fame" to his *first* decade.

The artifact includes a concrete twelve-month refresh list (AMP composition, counts, 2027 cohort, new interviews — especially anything where he asks about the name "Duke," which would obsolete the ending first).
